    "details": "Chrome Releases reports:\n\n> This update includes 15 security fixes:\n>\n> - \\[534923522\\] Critical CVE-2026-76034: Buffer overflow in WebGL.\n> - \\[540087398\\] Critical CVE-2026-76036: Buffer overflow in Dawn.\n> - \\[516715010\\] High CVE-2026-76033: Inappropriate implementation in\n>   CORS.\n> - \\[517612295\\] High CVE-2026-76037: Link following in\n>   CredentialProvider.\n> - \\[522732244\\] High CVE-2026-76044: Race condition in USB.\n> - \\[525167753\\] High CVE-2026-76039: Incorrect reference resolution in\n>   Core.\n> - \\[534862220\\] High CVE-2026-76040: Use after free in Browser.\n> - \\[536439844\\] High CVE-2026-76035: Inappropriate implementation in\n>   Media.\n> - \\[536460270\\] High CVE-2026-76042: Use of uninitialized resource in\n>   GPU.\n> - \\[536581050\\] High CVE-2026-76046: Buffer overflow in ANGLE.\n> - \\[539350801\\] High CVE-2026-76043: Incorrect calculation in V8.\n> - \\[540027341\\] High CVE-2026-76041: Information leak in Skia.\n> - \\[541251902\\] High CVE-2026-76047: Type confusion in V8.\n> - \\[541926503\\] High CVE-2026-76038: Type confusion in V8.\n> - \\[543082390\\] High CVE-2026-76045: Use after free in WebGL.\n",
